# Public-cleanliness denylist for scripts/scan_public.py.
# Each entry is the SHA-256 hex digest of a lowercased private token or
# token n-gram (tokens are [a-z0-9]+ runs, n-grams joined by one space).
# Plaintext terms are never stored here; add new terms by hashing them.
# Generic path/secret/domain patterns live in scan_public.py itself.
